% INVALID certificate (test of the checker): the LP  x >= 1/2, x <= 1/2  with x CONTINUOUS is feasible (x = 1/2),
% but D1 "rounds" x >= 1/2 to x >= 1, which is valid only for an integer variable.  A sound checker must reject it.
VER 1.1
VAR 1
x
INT 0
OBJ min
0
CON 2 0
C1 G 1/2 1 0 1
C2 L 1/2 1 0 1
RTP infeas
SOL 0
DER 2
D1 G 1 1 0 1 { rnd 1 0 1 } -1
D2 G 1/2 0 { lin 2 2 1 1 -1 } -1
